+<p>The first target is infinite. Every lifted scalar specialization
+below fixes external absence and sends a represented scalar zero to the
+represented zero of the receiving ring.</p>
+<p>Keep the original theta complex, source function, full packet, and
+sum coordinate:</p>
+<div class="equation-block"><math display="block" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mo>+</mo></msub><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo form="prefix" stretchy="true">[</mo><mi>V</mi><mover><mo>→</mo><mi>Θ</mi></mover><mi>ℬ</mi><mo form="postfix" stretchy="true">]</mo></mrow><mo>,</mo><mspace width="1.0em"></mspace><mi>Q</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>ℬ</mi><mi>/</mi><mi>Θ</mi><mi>V</mi><mo>,</mo><mspace width="1.0em"></mspace><mi>D</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>−</mi><mi>x</mi><msub><mi>∂</mi><mi>x</mi></msub><mo>,</mo><mspace width="1.0em"></mspace><mi>g</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>ξ</mi><mo>,</mo><mspace width="1.0em"></mspace><mi>h</mi><mrow><mo form="prefix" stretchy="true">(</mo><mi>s</mi><mo form="postfix" stretchy="true">)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><munder><mo>∏</mo><mi>ρ</mi></munder><msup><mrow><mo form="prefix" stretchy="true">(</mo><mi>s</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>ρ</mi><mo form="postfix" stretchy="true">)</mo></mrow><msub><mi>m</mi><mi>ρ</mi></msub></msup><mi>.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">
+C_+=[V\xrightarrow{\Theta}\mathscr B],\quad
