+<p>where
+<math display="inline" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>s</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><mi>⋯</mi><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>s</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">S=s_1+\cdots+s_k</annotation></semantics></math>,
+not its average. The existing cyclic inclusion is</p>
+<div class="equation-block"><math display="block" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><semantics><mrow><mi>η</mi><mo>:</mo><mi>E</mi><mo>↪</mo><msubsup><mi>E</mi><mi>h</mi><mrow><mi>⊗</mi><mi>k</mi></mrow></msubsup><mo>,</mo><mspace width="2.0em"></mspace><mi>η</mi><mrow><mo form="prefix" stretchy="true">[</mo><mi>P</mi><mo form="postfix" stretchy="true">]</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mi>υ</mi><mi>h</mi><mrow><mi>⊗</mi><mi>k</mi></mrow></msubsup><mi>P</mi><mrow><mo form="prefix" stretchy="true">(</mo><msub><mi>A</mi><mi>k</mi></msub><mo form="postfix" stretchy="true">)</mo></mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mspace width="1.0em"></mspace><msub><mi>υ</mi><mi>h</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>j</mi><mi>h</mi></msub><mrow><mo form="prefix" stretchy="true">(</mo><mi>g</mi><mi>/</mi><mi>h</mi><mo form="postfix" stretchy="true">)</mo></mrow><mi>.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">
